OL,3,ASuspect linked to Monaco bomb attack on
OL,4,Amillionaire speaks to BBC from
OL,5,AUkrainian prison
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian-born businessman Vadym
OL,8,FYermolayev and his 13-year-old son were
OL,9,Fbadly hurt in the blast and his partner
OL,10,Fsuffered catastrophic injuries.
OL,11,FYermolayev later described their
OL,12,Fsurvival as "nothing short of a
OL,13,Fmiracle".
OL,15,FZhykovych describes himself as a
OL,16,F"freelancer" for Ukraine's SBU security
OL,17,Fservice and says Anastasia Berezovska,
OL,18,Fthe woman caught on camera planting the
OL,19,Fbomb in Monaco, was his "agent".
